                <pb facs="0619" n="599" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg599"/>

                <head>[Enclosures.]</head>
                <p>Received, March 11, from William Ebbett, prisoner of war, one money bag,
                    (unopened,) and one knife.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN FUREY, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Assist. Paymaster, U.S.
                            Steamer Monticello.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
